docs {
  # Deletes the specified failure detection parameter set | maturity=EARLY_ADOPTER

  You cannot delete the set that is used by any failure detection rule. 

  If you need to delete such a set, switch the rule to a new set or delete the rule first.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** WriteConfig
}
